WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:02.480
Your history is searchable.

2
00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:04.080
Now you can choose whether

3
00:00:04.080 --> 00:00:05.760
to start turning useful parts

4
00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.280
of it into a personal

5
00:00:07.280 --> 00:00:09.440
guide for your AI.

6
00:00:09.440 --> 00:00:11.360
This is how Continuum helps

7
00:00:11.360 --> 00:00:12.960
carry forward things like your

8
00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:16.640
preferences, decisions, and lessons.

9
00:00:16.640 --> 00:00:18.480
The assistant reads a small

10
00:00:18.480 --> 00:00:20.640
group of conversation sections and

11
00:00:20.640 --> 00:00:23.040
looks for information worth keeping.

12
00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.120
We call that a learning

13
00:00:25.120 --> 00:00:26.480
round.

14
00:00:26.480 --> 00:00:28.640
For example, you might have

15
00:00:28.640 --> 00:00:30.240
explained that you want to

16
00:00:30.240 --> 00:00:32.000
see a few design options

17
00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.760
before choosing one.

18
00:00:33.760 --> 00:00:35.520
The assistant can save that

19
00:00:35.520 --> 00:00:37.040
preference with a reference to

20
00:00:37.040 --> 00:00:38.800
the words you used.

21
00:00:38.800 --> 00:00:40.960
That's an example, not something

22
00:00:40.960 --> 00:00:43.360
we're assuming about you.

23
00:00:43.360 --> 00:00:45.600
Continuum checks that the quoted

24
00:00:45.600 --> 00:00:47.120
words really appear in the

25
00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:48.400
conversation.

26
00:00:48.400 --> 00:00:49.920
The reference lets you look

27
00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.600
back at the source.

28
00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:53.280
It doesn't guarantee that the

29
00:00:53.280 --> 00:00:56.590
assistant interpreted you correctly.

30
00:00:56.590 --> 00:00:58.510
If a detail is wrong

31
00:00:58.510 --> 00:01:00.830
or your preference changes, you

32
00:01:00.830 --> 00:01:02.750
can correct it during normal

33
00:01:02.750 --> 00:01:03.390
use.

34
00:01:03.390 --> 00:01:04.910
You don't need to check

35
00:01:04.910 --> 00:01:08.590
thousands of old conversations upfront.

36
00:01:08.590 --> 00:01:10.990
The saved details build your

37
00:01:10.990 --> 00:01:12.750
personal guide,

38
00:01:12.750 --> 00:01:16.190
called your constitution, and pages

39
00:01:16.190 --> 00:01:18.110
for different topics.

40
00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.510
Your connected AI can use

41
00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:22.430
these to get useful background

42
00:01:22.430 --> 00:01:22.900
without reading your whole history
